{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/follow_whitelist.gif?t=1742923520\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/1-card-shuffle.gif?t=1742923520\" /><br><br>Get ready for Megabattle, a roguelike card game that combines strategic deckbuilding elements with the thrill of epic robot battles. Build a custom deck and embark on a procedurally generated journey, facing increasingly challenging trials.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/2-deckbuilding.gif?t=1742923520\" /><br><br>In Megabattle, each victory brings valuable rewards in the form of parts and upgrade cards. Utilize these resources to enhance your deck, making your robot more powerful and resilient. During battles, strategically play cards to improve your parts, attack opponents, and defend against enemy assaults.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/3-mechanics.gif?t=1742923520\" /><br><br>Explore various robot classes, each with their own unique characteristics and obtainable parts. Discover new attack cards and exclusive power-ups to strengthen your arsenal and adapt to different battle strategies.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/4-classes.gif?t=1742923520\" /><br><br>With an immersive sci-fi/futuristic atmosphere, Megabattle transports you to a universe filled with robots, advanced technology, and thrilling action.<br><br>Prepare for battle and claim victory in Megabattle!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/5-victory.gif?t=1742923520\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/